OL,3,GNEWSAExplosive expert's Gaza work
OL,4,Arecognised with medal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn explosive disposal expert has been
OL,7,Fgiven an award for his work in Gaza.
OL,9,FGary Toombs worked with an
OL,10,Finternational charity protecting
OL,11,Fcivilians in the Palestinian city
OL,12,Fduring the Israel-Gaza conflict, which
OL,13,Fbegan in 2023.
OL,15,FToombs, from New Waltham, near Grimsby,
OL,16,Fwas part of a mine clearance team
OL,17,Fawarded the Humanitarian Medal, which
OL,18,Fis given by the government to those in
OL,19,Fpublic service who respond to crises in
OL,20,Fsupport of human welfare.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
