OL,3,GNEWSAExplosive expert's Gaza work
OL,4,Arecognised with medal
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the award recognised "an
OL,7,Fextraordinary team of people who work
OL,8,Fto protect civilians and humanitarian
OL,9,Fworkers in some of the most difficult
OL,10,Fcircumstances imaginable".
